    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffLocalCmsServer` is the local CMS server module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for local CMS server activation and runtime topology. CMS behavior belongs in content modules such as `cms` and `wcms`."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Local server settings should remain explicit, replaceable, and isolated from shared capability logic."
    }
  ],
